{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>被困韓國釜山人工水道的鯊魚，終於被成功引導返回大海。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SK.SHARK-1030_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Z4CTGTHC8p1792641730.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>這條被困在北港親水公園狹窄水道逾一個月的鯊魚「小北港」，在韓國當局海陸空大動員下，周三終於離開水道。當局出動浮筒和大漁網，將「小北港」引導返回大海。有潛水員下水檢查漁網有沒有纏住鯊魚，地面上有獸醫團隊監測鯊魚健康情況，空中則有無人機即時監控鯊魚位置，確保行動順利進行。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SK.SHARK-1030.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261LMdlnHv011792641746.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>有專家指，近日水溫下降，不適合鯊魚生存，當局早前兩次引導行動都未能成功，原本選擇等「小北港」自行離開，但出於對其健康的擔憂，因此展開第三次引導行動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:01:07.973893+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:38:09.861853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:57:56.599947+00:00","content_hash":"50baf98ce5fe67853d0f8e776a8156e7bb46e3fd6fa7f00e3ad8617d62894bd8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}